ALL CHECKS PASSED.
CONCLUSION: with every currently published lower bound on A(n,d,w) and
A(m,d), the Edel-Rains-Sloane construction maximised over ALL admissible
chains reproduces the best known kissing number in every dimension 32-44
and improves none of them.
